OL,3,GNEWSANearly 80% of responses to council
OL,4,Asurvey opposed to visitor levy
OL,5,
OL,6,FNearly 80% of respondents to a
OL,7,Fconsultation have voiced opposition to
OL,8,FArgyll and Bute Council's latest
OL,9,Fproposals for a visitor levy.
OL,11,FA total of 1,910 responses were
OL,12,Freceived by the authority during the
OL,13,Fsurvey, which ran from July to October.
OL,15,FCouncil officials raised the
OL,16,Fpossibility of a flat #5 per room/area,
OL,17,Fper night rate, after a previous
OL,18,Fproposal for a 5% charge did not
OL,19,Fattract support.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
