OL,3,GNEWSANearly 80% of responses to council
OL,4,Asurvey opposed to visitor levy
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, a total of 79.6% of 1,873
OL,7,Frespondents are reported to have
OL,8,Fexpressed a negative view on the new
OL,9,Fproposal, including 94.2% who responded
OL,10,Fas visitors.
